    "selection": "Past-closed training outcomes only, all5assets retained, fixed models before validation. Complete candidate stream is materialized once from actual production admission/indicators/qualification/arbitration. Shadow labels one active proposal per role/asset. Combined simulation one arbitrator and three active underlying symbols; no opposed publications. Every15mclose allowed.25bps/37.5stress;96barsnextopen full target.",
